<TUV xml:lang='de-DE'>StMin</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Separation Time (minimum). The minimum time the sender shall wait between the transmissions of two Consecutive frames.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='de-DE'>Minimale Zeit, die der Sender zwischen der Übertragung zweier Consecutive Frames warten muß.</TUV>
</DESC>
